/Title (These visuals are ideal for representing "part-to-whole" relationships and illustrating categorical proportions. By focusing on the arc length, they allow the viewer to quickly understand the distribution of a total amount among various segments and evaluate the relative weight of each category.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1541 0 R
/Prev 1544 0 R
>>
